[Classical Art Museums: Genuine Masterpieces > The Pinakotheks in Munich: Masterpieces Around Every Corner]

The Kunstareal in Maxvorstadt is home to a cluster of top-class museums. Internationally best known are the three Pinakothek museums, where visitors can admire great art from the 13th century to the present day. The Alte Pinakothek, which was the largest museum building in the world when it opened in 1836, contains, nominally speaking, the comparatively oldest works. And what a collection it is!&#x20;
